"based on the ARM Cortex-M processor is designed to offer new degrees of "
"freedom to MCU users. It offers a 32-bit product range that combines very "
"high performance, real-time capabilities, digital signal processing, and low-"
"power, low-voltage operation, while maintaining full integration and ease of "
"development."
